              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After this unit resolves its attacks in a fight, you can use this ability, if this model has destroyed one or more enemy units with those attacks:
  - Select one enemy unit that is unengaged, within 12" of this model and visible to this model:
