            <cost name="Enhancements" typeId="f759-1bc4-cb3a-f0d2" value="1"/>
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
    </selectionEntryGroup>
  </sharedSelectionEntryGroups>
  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Code Chivalric" id="7d93-51b3-fd61-3213" hidden="false">
      <description>Choose one of the following (Select Deed):
  - Choose one of the following (Quality: Martial Valour): you can re-roll Hit rolls of 1 with ranged weapons / you can re-roll Hit rolls of 1 with melee weapons / you can re-roll Wound rolls of 1 with ranged weapons / you can re-roll Wound rolls of 1 with melee weapons; if this unit has the CHARACTER keyword, when destroyed by any attack, friendly units are designated as Oath Fulfilled.
  - Choose one of the following (Quality: Eager for Challenge): add 2" to this unit's Move characteristic / add 1 to this unit's Advance rolls / add 1 to this unit's Charge rolls; if you hold more objectives than your opponent, friendly units are designated as Oath Fulfilled.
  - Choose one of the following (Quality: Legacy Unsullied): add 2 to this unit's Objective Control characteristic / add 1 to this unit's Leadership characteristic; if you destroyed at least 0 enemy units this turn, friendly units are designated as Oath Fulfilled.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Bondsman" id="5a02-96fa-cd86-e47a" hidden="false">
      <description>Nothing happens.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Super-heavy Walker" id="8789-fe15-fdef-1305" hidden="false">
      <description>When this model ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move:
  - The triggering unit can move over non-Titanic models as though they were not there.
  - The triggering unit can move over terrain features 4" or lower as though they were not there.
  - The triggering unit is eligible to move even if it is within Engagement Range of enemy units.
  - The triggering unit cannot end a move within Engagement Range of any enemy unit, during its Normal, Advance and Fall Back moves.
  - The triggering unit can move over terrain features over 4" as though they were not there.
When this model moves through terrain over 4" tall:
  - Roll one D6:
    - On 1: This unit is Battle-shocked.
    - On 2-6: Nothing happens.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Freeblades" id="23c7-ce00-8ab2-6f48" hidden="false">
      <description>If every model in your army has the IMPERIUM keyword, you can use this ability:
  Choose one of the following:
    - Your army can include at most 1 models from TITANIC IMPERIAL KNIGHTS units.
    - Your army can include at most 3 models from ARMIGER units.
  - Friendly TITANIC IMPERIAL KNIGHTS or ARMIGER units cannot be your Warlord.
  - Friendly TITANIC IMPERIAL KNIGHTS or ARMIGER units cannot be given Enhancements.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
